  <data>
    <entry>
      <string>longDescription</string>
      <string>This is a graphical and tabular representation of the movement of the data between the various tiers of storage caused by Dynamic Tiering algorithms. Shows the usage the indiviapt_v_dual tiers over time including the peak and the delta between the first sample and the last sample. These metrics can be used for capacity planning and chargeback purposes.  </string>
    </entry>
